arter would find this information extremely valuable. We could also provide a service to a prospective user of a crowdfunding campaign, on ways that they can optimize their campaign itself to give themselves the best chance of being successful.","topics":[],"score":180052,"global_rank":404499},{"name":"ahmedgedi/wifi-scanner-gui","owner":"ahmedgedi","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmedgedi/wifi-scanner-gui","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180052,"global_rank":404500},{"name":"jwhite007/KeychainExport","owner":"jwhite007","html_url":"https://github.com/jwhite007/KeychainExport","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180050,"global_rank":404501},{"name":"leopd/hookbox-demo","owner":"leopd","html_url":"https://github.com/leopd/hookbox-demo","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Demo of real-time web development with hookbox","topics":[],"score":180046,"global_rank":404503},{"name":"SaloniDash7/Resources","owner":"SaloniDash7","html_url":"https://github.com/SaloniDash7/Resources","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Resources to kick-start your Machine Learning Journey","topics":[],"score":180046,"global_rank":404504},{"name":"pooja-choudhari/SQL-Challeges-Projects-","owner":"pooja-choudhari","html_url":"https://github.com/pooja-choudhari/SQL-Challeges-Projects-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This repository contains all the SQL challenges and projects done from various resources for learning purpose. ","topics":[],"score":180045,"global_rank":404505},{"name":"morghan102/morghan102","owner":"morghan102","html_url":"https://github.com/morghan102/morghan102","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":